\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1.1}{\ignorespaces Block diagram tracing a five-stage operational architecture for autonomous robots, sequencing raw sensory input, feature state encoding, deep self-model kinematics processing, tracking control planning, and joint execution loops.}}{3}{figure.caption.6}%
